---
/**
 * AIInsightsSection.astro — AI & Intent Scoring (Active Development).
 * WD-033. High-fidelity UI snippet with glowing "High Intent" badges.
 * Secondary CTA: "View Our Product Roadmap" (outline/ghost button).
 */
---

<section class="sec sec-ai seam" id="ai">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Active Development</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Intent Scoring is live. <em>Full autonomy is next.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">We already flag the leads showing high buying intent so our users can strike immediately. We are actively engineering the AI infrastructure to handle the initial replies while they sleep.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- UI Snippet: Lead List & Inbox with Glowing "High Intent" Badges -->
    <div class="ai-ui-stage" data-reveal data-d="1">
      <div class="bframe ai-frame">
        <div class="chrome">
          <span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="url">app.synclead.io/inbox/intent-stream</span>
          <span class="chrome-tag-violet">AI INTENT v2.4 ACTIVE</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pnl ai-panel">
          <!-- Live Stream Filter Bar -->
          <div class="stream-bar">
            <div class="stream-filters">
              <span class="filter-pill active">
                <i class="flt-dot"></i>
                All Priority Leads (4)
              </span>
              <span class="filter-pill">High Intent Only (3)</span>
              <span class="filter-pill">Meetings Requested (1)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="autonomy-status">
              <span class="pulse-violet"></span>
              <span class="autonomy-txt">Autonomy Engine: Training on Sequence Corpus</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- AI Growth Insights Card (From Journey Page 11) -->
          <div class="growth-insights-card">
            <div class="gic-header">
              <div class="gic-title">
                <span class="gic-icon">✦</span>
                <strong>AI Growth Insights</strong>
              </div>
              <span class="gic-badge">REAL-TIME OPTIMIZATION</span>
            </div>
            <div class="gic-items">
              <div class="gic-item">
                <span class="gic-dot"></span>
                <p>“Q4 Enterprise” reply rates are <strong>40% higher on Tuesdays before 10 AM</strong>. Consider shifting volume.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="gic-item">
                <span class="gic-dot"></span>
                <p>3 domains showing <strong>'Neutral' sentiment</strong> in replies. Triggering follow-up sequence B.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gic-action">
              <button class="gic-btn" type="button">Apply Optimization +</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Lead List Items -->
          <div class="lead-stream">
            <!-- Prospect 1: High Intent (Glowing) -->
            <div class="lead-row high-intent">
              <div class="lead-avatar">
                <span>SC</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lead-main">
                <div class="lead-meta">
                  <span class="lead-name">Sarah Chen</span>
                  <span class="lead-role">VP Growth @ HyperScale Cloud</span>
                  <span class="lead-time">14m ago</span>
                </div>
                <p class="lead-snippet">
                  “We're currently scaling from 10 to 45 SDR mailboxes. Can your multi-IP pool guarantee domain reputation for our enterprise migration next month? Need 30 min this week.”
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="lead-badges">
                {/* Intent score hidden per founder directive */}
                <span class="intent-tag book-now">Ready to Book</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Prospect 2: High Intent -->
            <div class="lead-row high-intent">
              <div class="lead-avatar av-blue">
                <span>MR</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lead-main">
                <div class="lead-meta">
                  <span class="lead-name">Michael Rodriguez</span>
                  <span class="lead-role">Head of Revenue Ops @ DataMesh</span>
                  <span class="lead-time">42m ago</span>
                </div>
                <p class="lead-snippet">
                  “The no-show recovery sequence you mentioned sounds exactly like what our reps need. What does implementation look like with Google Workspace?”
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="lead-badges">
                {/* Intent score hidden per founder directive */}
                <span class="intent-tag eval">Evaluating Stack</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Prospect 3: Warm Information Request -->
            <div class="lead-row">
              <div class="lead-avatar av-emerald">
                <span>EP</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lead-main">
                <div class="lead-meta">
                  <span class="lead-name">Elena Rostova</span>
                  <span class="lead-role">Demand Gen Director @ FinFlow</span>
                  <span class="lead-time">2h ago</span>
                </div>
                <p class="lead-snippet">
                  “Sending volume limits on our primary domain just got flagged. How fast can you stand up 8 secondary mailboxes?”
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="lead-badges">
                {/* Intent score hidden per founder directive */}
                <span class="intent-tag tech">Infra Question</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Autonomy Preview Banner -->
          <div class="autonomy-banner">
            <div class="banner-left">
              <span class="tag-soon">NEXT SHIPMENT</span>
              <strong>Autonomous Reply Orchestration</strong>
              <span>Autonomous AI agents handling preliminary qualification & objections while reps sleep.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="banner-right">
              <span class="eta-tag font-mono">STAGING · Q4 2026</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Secondary CTA Button (Ghost / Outline style) -->
    <div class="roadmap-cta" data-reveal data-d="2">
      <a class="btn btn-outline-ghost btn-lg" href="/roadmap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"/>
          <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"/>
          <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"/>
        </svg>
        View Our Product Roadmap
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sec-ai {
    position: relative;
    background: #080B18;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sec-ai::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -240px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 900px;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.16), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-ui-stage {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-frame {
    background: rgba(10, 14, 30, 0.95);
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 50px -20px rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .chrome-tag-violet {
    font: 600 9px var(--f-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.35);
    color: var(--color-violet-2);
  }

  .ai-panel {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  /* AI Growth Insights Card (Page 11) */
  .growth-insights-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(108, 88, 232, 0.18), rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.06));
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(108, 88, 232, 0.25);
  }
  .gic-header {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .gic-title {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 600 13px var(--f-ui); color: #fff;
  }
  .gic-icon { color: var(--color-violet); font-size: 14px; }
  .gic-badge {
    font: 600 8px var(--f-mono); letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.16); color: var(--color-violet);
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .gic-items { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .gic-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; font: 400 12px var(--f-ui); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .gic-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-violet); margin-top: 5px; flex: none; }
  .gic-item strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .gic-action { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .gic-btn {
    font: 600 11.5px var(--f-ui); padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-violet); color: #fff; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .gic-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* Stream Bar */
  .stream-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(151, 166, 199, 0.1);
  }
  .stream-filters {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .filter-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font: 500 11.5px var(--f-ui);
    color: var(--ink-3);
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(151, 166, 199, 0.08);
  }
  .filter-pill.active {
    color: var(--ink);
    background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .flt-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-violet);
  }

  .autonomy-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font: 500 11px var(--f-mono);
    color: var(--color-violet-2);
  }
  .pulse-violet {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-violet);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--color-violet);
    animation: beat 2.4s infinite;
  }

  /* Lead stream */
  .lead-stream {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .lead-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(151, 166, 199, 0.08);
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease), border-color 0.25s;
  }
  .lead-row:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .lead-row.high-intent {
    background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.04);
    border-color: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.24);
  }

  .lead-avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6C58E8, #9D8BFF);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font: 700 12px var(--f-mono);
    color: #fff;
    flex: none;
  }
  .lead-avatar.av-blue {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0E86C8, #41C8FF);
  }
  .lead-avatar.av-emerald {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #18A058, #3DD68C);
  }

  .lead-main {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .lead-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .lead-name {
    font: 600 14px var(--f-ui);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .lead-role {
    font: 400 12px var(--f-ui);
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .lead-time {
    font: 500 10.5px var(--f-mono);
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .lead-snippet {
    font: 400 13px/1.5 var(--f-ui);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 5px;
  }

  /* Badges */
  .lead-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 6px;
    flex: none;
  }
  .intent-score-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(151, 166, 199, 0.15);
  }
  .intent-score-badge.glow-violet {
    background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.45);
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px -4px rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.45);
  }
  .intent-fire {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .score-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .score-label {
    font: 600 7.5px var(--f-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-violet-2);
  }
  .score-val {
    font: 700 11.5px var(--f-mono);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .intent-tag {
    font: 600 8.5px var(--f-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .intent-tag.book-now {
    background: rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(61, 214, 140, 0.3);
    color: var(--color-ok);
  }
  .intent-tag.eval {
    background: rgba(65, 200, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(65, 200, 255, 0.25);
    color: var(--color-sky);
  }
  .intent-tag.tech {
    background: rgba(151, 166, 199, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(151, 166, 199, 0.2);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  /* Autonomy banner */
  .autonomy-banner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(108, 88, 232, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(108, 88, 232, 0.25);
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .banner-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .tag-soon {
    font: 700 8px var(--f-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-violet-2);
  }
  .banner-left strong {
    font: 600 13.5px var(--f-ui);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .banner-left span {
    font: 400 12px var(--f-ui);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .eta-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-violet-2);
    background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.1);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.25);
  }

  /* Secondary Ghost/Outline CTA */
  .roadmap-cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .btn-outline-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.35);
    color: var(--color-violet-2);
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
    font: 600 14.5px var(--f-ui);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s var(--ease);
  }
  .btn-outline-ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(157, 139, 255, 0.6);
    color: #fff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -10px rgba(108, 88, 232, 0.35);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .lead-row { flex-direction: column; }
    .lead-badges { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: row; margin-top: 6px; }
  }
</style>
